title: "REIGN: Refurbished Embeddings with Integrated Guidance Networks"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of REIGN, a lightweight guidance-network architecture
  that scales the effective context length of pretrained text encoders for
  long-document retrieval without full-model fine-tuning.
